  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **`IProcessLock.LastHoldersDescription()` says who holds the lock,** for whoever is refused it and says so in words of its own: what the holder that took it last wrote of itself, what for, which process, on which machine and since when, in the words a `Take` that gives up says it in. Null if no holder has written it yet.\n- **Internal: the interprocess signal is Compze.Threading.Interprocess's own again,** now that Compze.Teventive.MemoryImageStateStore no longer tells other memory images of its commits.",
